  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian state logistics agency, Perum Bulog, is currently coordinating with Commission IV of the House of Representatives to improve the efficiency and reach of government-led rice distribution programs in the Lampung region. This collaborative effort focuses on ensuring that food aid effectively reaches the intended communities. The project follows recent regional distribution activities involving public figures such as Titiek Soeharto, who has participated in delivering similar aid. Beyond specific distribution events in Lampung, the national strategy for food security involves multiple stakeholders, including ministerial supervision by the Coordinating Ministry for Food, banking sector support for food ecosystems, and local initiatives like the SPHP rice programs conducted by law enforcement in Jakarta. These measures are intended to maintain price stability and ensure consistent access to essential food supplies across various provinces in Indonesia.",
